Z||000009||zeusrekning||02-23-2001||09:16 AM||||My g/f's mom took her caddy to a local shop, cause it was running funny and someone removed the ""Smog pump"". A bunch of people told here that doing that will blow the computer. She had the shop replace the smog pump and a used comp. Still not right.(check engine light stayed on.)put a new computer on. Well that wasn't it.Wound up being an alternator wire. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> imagine if we chaged comp.'s everytime the check engine light came on.||||reg||1
