Z||000011||rogergarrison||02-23-2001||11:15 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by zeusrekning:<BR><B>My g/f's mom took her caddy to a local shop, cause it was running funny and someone removed the ""Smog pump"". A bunch of people told here that doing that will blow the computer. She had the shop replace the smog pump and a used comp. Still not right.(check engine light stayed on.)put a new computer on. Well that wasn't it.Wound up being an alternator wire.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> imagine if we chaged comp.'s everytime the check engine light came on.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>id be getting a full refund from the shop that replaced cmptr and pump!!! If they didnt id tell em to put the old one back in or I would see them in court.<P>||||reg||1
